# Paths graphify must not index. Read after .gitignore and following the same spec, so
# everything already gitignored (graft/, dist/, .mercato/, node_modules/) is excluded
# for free — only tracked-but-unwanted paths belong here.
#
# See .ai/docs/code-navigation.md.

# Upstream, the scaffolder template mirrors apps/mercato/src/app byte-for-byte, so indexing
# both sides doubles the node count and makes every hit ambiguous. This fork carries no
# template and no sync script (there is no `yarn template:sync:fix`) — neither path exists
# in the working tree, so both are listed defensively and the entries are inert.
packages/create-app/template/
packages/cli/template/

# Auto-generated registries and build artefacts — regenerated by `yarn generate`,
# never a useful search result.
**/generated/
**/.docusaurus/
